  "body": "**Stacked on #666** (#664, setup picks disarm on page change). Review only this PR's own commit, `75c8b710`.\n\n**P2 (#667, found in M5's review of #666):** #666's disarm sweep ran inside `pages::properties`, so only while the Properties tab was drawn. With the tab closed or hidden behind another tab, an armed Setups pick stayed armed and viewport clicks fed the hidden draft.\n\n## What changed\n- **`shell_layout`** wraps the dock with the sweep, once per frame.\n  - **Before the dock:** if `layout::is_shown(dock, Properties)` is false, `axis_pick::disarm_all` runs. `is_shown` is new: the tab is in the dock, active in its leaf, and the leaf isn't collapsed.\n  - **After the dock:** `axis_pick::disarm_hidden` runs.\n- **Ordering:** viewport clicks are routed inside the dock, and egui_dock draws leaves by node index, so the viewport can draw before Properties.\n  - The before-dock check closes the one-frame gap: a pane hidden by a click in frame N-1 is disarmed before frame N's viewport runs.\n  - It also stops a stale `axis_rows_shown` from letting `hint_stray` swallow clicks while the pane is closed.\n  - This is documented at the call site and in `docs/decisions/667-sweep-every-frame.md`.\n- **`pages::properties`** loses #666's wrapper and is back to a single function. The rows still mark themselves.\n\n## How tested\n- **`setup_picks_disarm`, now 5 tests (headless, real clicks through the View door):**\n  - `an_axis_pick_disarms_when_the_properties_tab_is_closed`: arm +Y by Edge and pick, close Properties, click the part, and the draft is unchanged. Reopening shows \"Pick +Y edge\" with the edge kept.\n  - `a_plane_pick_disarms_when_another_tab_hides_the_properties_pane`: opening Machines in front of Properties disarms the face pick. Closing Machines shows \"Pick a face\" with the face kept.\n  - Both fail without the fix. #666's three tests still pass.\n- **Gate:**\n  - ui lib 391 pass. The 1 failure is the known no-GPU `headless_run_succeeds` in the agent sandbox;\n  - boundary_picks, edge_loop_pick and operations pass;\n  - clippy is clean. No snapshot PNGs changed.\n\nChangelog: A Setups page pick (axis by Edge or Two points, or lay-on-a-plane) now disarms when the Properties tab is closed or hidden behind another tab, so viewport clicks no longer feed the hidden setup draft (#667)\n\nFixes #667\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
